<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar experts leave molasses duties unchanged.</title>
<headline>EU sugar experts leave molasses duties unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday left duties on cane and beet molasses imports unchanged from the previous week, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee set the duty for cane molasses at the ordinary, full rate of 0.41 Ecus per 100 kg, unchanged from the previous week's figure, and beet molasses duty remains fixed at zero,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The reference price for beet remained unchanged at 11.06 Ecus per 100 kg. The reference price for cane molasses changed only slightly to 7.42 Ecus per 100 kg from 7.43 Ecus last week.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
